groovebox-scene 1
# A beat entered by steps from an empty project. Syn 1 on pad 1 through the panel: MENU + step 3
# shows SOUND's Pad page and OK opens the sound picker on Empty; down twice to New synth and OK
# choose it.
input 3200 press menu
input 4800 press step-3
input 6400 release step-3
input 8000 release menu
input 9600 press ok
input 11200 release ok
input 12800 press down
input 14400 release down
input 16000 press down
input 17600 release down
input 19200 press ok
input 20800 release ok
# Taps of steps 1, 5, 9 and 13 enter four notes of Syn 1 in bar 1 and light their steps.
input 22400 press step-1
input 24000 release step-1
input 25600 press step-5
input 27200 release step-5
input 28800 press step-9
input 30400 release step-9
input 32000 press step-13
input 33600 release step-13
frame 35200
# PLAY starts bar 1 at its press and lights; the 1-bar pattern loops every 96,000 samples. In the
# first pass the music is in step 5, which the flip darkens, and pad 1 lights while its note sounds.
input 38400 press play
input 40000 release play
frame 64000
# After two passes, a tap of step 3 adds a note that the third pass plays.
input 232000 press step-3
input 233600 release step-3
# SHIFT + PLAY jumps to the start of the cursor's bar, bar 1, at once.
input 246400 press shift
input 248000 press play
input 249600 release play
input 251200 release shift
# STOP ends the sounding note of step 5 with its release; PLAY starts bar 1 again, and STOP stops
# it while the note of step 3 sounds. A second STOP fades every voice.
input 275200 press stop
input 276800 release stop
input 280000 press play
input 281600 release play
input 294400 press stop
input 296000 release stop
input 297600 press stop
input 299200 release stop
frame 300800
end 304000
